iscover more and more catastrophes are being orchestrated to devastate Shanghai piece by piece. It's up two Salem and Rios to uncover the secret of the 40th Day and survive the chaos.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/army-of-two-the-40th-day", "videos": [{"id": 2229, "name": "Multiplayer Trailer", "video_id": "NEk0-T6DGhQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NEk0-T6DGhQ", "title": "Army of Two: The 40th Day - Multiplayer Trailer (official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NEk0-T6DGhQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 2230, "name": "Intro Trailer", "video_id": "EPQv5OXdrBE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EPQv5OXdrBE", "title": "Army of Two: The 40th Day - Intro Trailer (official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EPQv5OXdrBE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 2228, "name": "Launch trailer", "video_id": "YS9Ot42iXBc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YS9Ot42iXBc", "title": "Army of Two: The 40th Day - Launch Trailer (official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YS9Ot42iXBc/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 222, "name": "Army of Two"}]}